		"Verified": "已验证",
		"Verified commit signature": "已验证的提交签名",
		// 签名弹层的两种来源共用同一个 `<strong>verified signature</strong>` 片段，
		// 两段前后文都必须接得通：
		//   GitHub 代签：`This commit was created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s`
		//                + `verified signature` → 此提交创建于 GitHub.com，并由 GitHub 的已验证签名签署。
		//   提交者自签：`This commit was signed with the committer’s`
		//                + `verified signature` → 此提交由提交者的已验证签名签署。
		// 故前一条以「GitHub 的」收尾、后一条以「提交者的」收尾，共享片段只保留名词 + 动词。
		"This commit was created on GitHub.com and signed with GitHub’s": "此提交创建于 GitHub.com，并由 GitHub 的",
		"This commit was signed with the committer’s": "此提交由提交者的",
		"verified signature": "已验证签名签署",
		"GPG key ID:": "GPG 密钥 ID：",
		"Learn about vigilant mode": "了解警惕模式",
